@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Preenchimento de Prontuário (Notes Service)

actor "Médico" as Doctor
participant "Notes-Service" as Notes
database "Notes DB\n(MongoDB)" as NotesDB
participant "Appointments-Service" as Appts

autonumber

Doctor -> Notes: PUT /records/appointment/{id}\n{diagnosis, prescription}
activate Notes

    Note right of Notes: Validação de Segurança\n@PreAuthorize("hasRole('PHYSICIAN')")

    Notes -> NotesDB: Find Record by AppointmentId
    alt Registo não encontrado (ainda não criado via RabbitMQ)
        Notes -> Appts: GET /appointments/internal/{id}
        activate Appts
            Appts --> Notes: 200 OK (Consulta existe)
        deactivate Appts
        Notes -> Notes: Cria novo objeto Record em memória
    end

    Notes -> Notes: Atualiza dados (Diagnóstico, Tratamento)
    Notes -> NotesDB: Save (Upsert)

    Notes --> Doctor: 200 OK "Detalhes atualizados"

deactivate Notes

@enduml
